# F03: LAB10a's view in the `z` x-ray, the z-buffer (near light, far dark) ("One thread or
# eight"). The diagram of a row stored 8 pixels at a time over it is the edit's.

map e1m1

duration 4
fps 60
size 1920x1080

preset slop
hud on
gun on
cvar gamma 0.8

camera fixed 480,-352,110 0,90

xray z

sound off
events on
